--- !u!1001 &157274959
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1083560582}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: topics.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Selamat datang di Festival Bahari! Setelah bertahun-tahun, akhirnya
        festival ini digelar lagi.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Lihat desa kita sekarang. Alun-alun bersih, kebun warga kembali panen,
        dermaga berdiri lagi, dan terumbu karang mulai pulih.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Semua ini berkat kerja kerasmu, bersama Pak Darma dan seluruh warga
        Desa Lembayung.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Tapi ingat, menjaga pulau ini bukan tugas satu hari. Mari terus rawat
        kebun, pesisir, dan laut kita.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[4].text
      value: Dengan ini, Festival Bahari Desa Lembayung resmi dibuka! Selamat bersenang-senang!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatLines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Nikmati festivalnya, ya! Hari ini kamu pahlawan desa kita.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[0].expression
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[1].expression
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[2].expression
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1863904237411138034, guid: 05d97627c7b856a4f80b5afaea6c8d69, type: 3}
      propertyPath: firstLines.Array.data[3].expression
